        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor recognized a new, actionable information gap (no antihypertensive in the system) and immediately shifted the priority from waiting for a specialist to resolving the acute need in a general medicine setting, integrating this into a clear, executable plan with timing and owner.",
