      "explanation": "The doctor actively screened for stroke, bleeding, and diabetic/swallowing risks and stated emergency escalation criteria in multiple turns (e.g., lite_evt_00075, lite_evt_00124, lite_evt_00168). No serious or minor error was found here.",
