          "quote": "拍照发给亲戚看说字太糊，我也分不清利伐沙班、氯吡格雷还有降糖药是不是都要继续吃"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor did not treat blurry documents as reliable, requested clearer photos, and asked to separate medication orders, test results, and pending examinations. No serious or minor error was found.",
